.TH COGTRIX-API 8 "2026-03-30" "cogtrix 1.0.0" "Cogtrix Manual"
.SH NAME
cogtrix-api \- API server system administration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python\ \-m\ src.api
.RB [ \-\-host
.IR HOST ]
.RB [ \-\-port
.IR PORT ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Cogtrix REST API server provides HTTP and WebSocket endpoints for
AI-powered conversational sessions with tool execution.
.SH STARTING THE SERVER
.PP
.nf
    uv run python -m src.api --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
.fi
.SS systemd unit example
.PP
.nf
    [Unit]
    Description=Cogtrix API Server
    After=network.target postgresql.service redis.service

    [Service]
    Type=simple
    User=cogtrix
    WorkingDirectory=/opt/cogtrix
    EnvironmentFile=/etc/cogtrix/env
    ExecStart=/opt/cogtrix/.venv/bin/python -m src.api
    Restart=on-failure

    [Install]
    WantedBy=multi-user.target
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
See
.BR cogtrix-api (5)
for all environment variables.
.SH RATE LIMITING
The server enforces 120 requests/minute per IP by default via slowapi middleware.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cogtrix-api (1),
.BR cogtrix-api (5),
.BR cogtrix (5)
